#| Lines beginning "#|" are notes to us and are stripped by render.sh. Everything else is
#| the manifest a winget-pkgs moderator reads, and it is kept short on purpose: rationale
#| belongs in packaging/winget/README.md, not in a file submitted to someone else's repo.
#|
#| InstallerType: zip + NestedInstallerType: portable
#|     Boks is a CLI, and the Windows artifact is a bundle rather than a lone binary: the
#|     CLI ships beside containerd, the nerdbox shim, krun.dll and the guest images,
#|     because Boks orchestrates a stack it does not contain. A zip is the only archive
#|     type winget unpacks, and `portable` is the only nested type that suits a CLI.
#|
#| No ArchiveBinariesDependOnPath
#|     Setting it true would put the whole extracted directory on the user's PATH —
#|     containerd.exe and ctr.exe included, shadowing a containerd they installed on
#|     purpose. Omitting it makes winget create one alias, `boks`, and leave the rest
#|     invisible. Boks finds its own bundle without PATH's help: internal/daemon/locate.go
#|     resolves the executable, follows the symlink, and searches the directory it lands in.
#|
#| MinimumOSVersion: 10.0.22000.0
#|     Windows 11 RTM. The Windows Hypervisor Platform predates it, but Windows 11 is the
#|     only thing this stack has ever been run on (docs/verification.md), so this is the
#|     floor we can state rather than the floor that might work.
#|
#| x64 only
#|     There is no Windows arm64 build. libkrun's WHP backend here is x86_64, and so is the
#|     guest kernel that has booted under it.
# Created by packaging/winget/render.sh in github.com/dagsommer/boks
# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://aka.ms/winget-manifest.installer.1.12.0.schema.json

PackageIdentifier: dagsommer.boks
PackageVersion: {{VERSION}}
InstallerType: zip
NestedInstallerType: portable
Platform:
- Windows.Desktop
MinimumOSVersion: 10.0.22000.0
Commands:
- boks
ReleaseDate: {{RELEASE_DATE}}
Installers:
- Architecture: x64
  NestedInstallerFiles:
  - RelativeFilePath: boks_{{VERSION}}_windows_amd64/boks.exe
    PortableCommandAlias: boks
  InstallerUrl: https://github.com/dagsommer/boks/releases/download/v{{VERSION}}/boks_{{VERSION}}_windows_amd64.zip
  InstallerSha256: {{INSTALLER_SHA256}}
ManifestType: installer
ManifestVersion: 1.12.0
